Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: install into every harness on PATH

Codex skips plugin hooks until their hash is trusted, so the installer
writes the trust entries through codex app-server.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AQXdCnr61gd6LLv441ZXZB
---
